  <name>Deepnest</name>
  <summary>Deep nesting for Laser and CNC</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Deepnest is an open-source nesting application for laser cutters, plasma
      cutters, and other CNC machines. It arranges 2D parts tightly onto sheets
      to minimize material waste.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Imports SVG and DXF parts (DXF/DWG/PS/EPS via the online converter)</li>
      <li>Part-in-part nesting and shared-edge optimization</li>
      <li>Multi-threaded nesting engine</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">net.deepnest.app.desktop</launchable>
